    "detailed_description": "<h1>&quot;The most unusual game&quot;</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special Award from Igroprom 24' : &quot;The most unusual game&quot;<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707160/extras/ae1b1c4e0a63969415d3b6cb8d1b5147.avif?t=1750874376\" width=798 height=1186 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Support this project by adding it to your WISHLIST and reposting on your social networks! We are creating it with a small independent team.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Chapter I in STEAM here if you have not yet touched this unusual world.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>But you can immediately play Chapter II - inside there is a small intro with backstory.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cI Know This Place..?\u201d Chapter II </strong>\u2013  this is a vibe mystical <u>TRANS-MEDIA</u> adventure with deep meaning in our strange game world, where you will see unusual plot twists, amazing locations and quirky characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And all of this <u>can be influenced by you personally</u>, because the plot of the chapters develops taking into account the votes of the players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the chapters of the game, our universe will be revealed in short films (watch in the game main menu), old audio recordings  and comics. And thanks to the introduction of ARG - games in alternative reality - we connect the world of the game and the real one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707160/extras/a8828295f7bf9821c2572fcc10da59c9.avif?t=1750874376\" width=600 height=156 /></span>What did scientist Vladimir Mashkov do and where is he? What's wrong with his apartment and the house in general. Such questions will torment you after visiting his strange apartment in Chapter I.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Chapter II we will leave Vladimir's apartment in search of answers, encountering even more questions along the way. We are starting to move away from complete linearity, and are also introducing more opportunities for our players and viewers to add items and (attention) entire story locations to the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707160/extras/0f6c0007c58c1d4bf951f675a1c54c98.avif?t=1750874376\" width=600 height=156 /></span>Do you have ideas for super strange plot twists, intriguing puzzles, and want to influence the plot of the next chapters?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to add your own memorable photo with a caption, or a photo of your grandmother to the game? Maybe some kind of memorable item, for example a book that your father loved to read as a child?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Or do you want to see in reality a children's room that no longer exists in real life? Grandfather's old car? Your father's garage or your grandmother's country house, in which a short story will unfold that you can write yourself with our help?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All this will now be available!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you already know, players can add items by winning competitions in our public. Other players will see your item in the game, and even the history and information about it. But we decided to go further: in Chapter II you will be able to get your own location according to your idea and plot. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into our friendly community in Telegram ( @IKTP_RU) and we\u2019ll show you together this unusual project to the world! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707160/extras/2b1fe0c0ee09c3b75dbc8d5b4ae98ece.avif?t=1750874376\" width=600 height=156 /></span>We are indie developers, the SameFrame association. We create worlds while sitting in a small town, without budgets, but with awe and love =) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Therefore, we are very grateful to your wonderful reviews about Chapter I, filled with sincere emotions about the game. Special thanks to Sony representatives for their warm feedback about our game at the exhibition in Lisbon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We thank everyone who supports and believes in us, we thank EpicGames and Nvidia for their technologies, we thank our parents, we thank RBL LABS for their help with the pilot episode.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Special thanks to subscribers:</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>P1gVo1ce</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Evgeny Ishin</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Anka_Tec9</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Maksin</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Glebory</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Support this project by adding it to your WISHLIST and reposting on your social networks! We are creating it with a small independent team.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Chapter I in STEAM here if you have not yet touched this unusual world.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>But you can immediately play Chapter II - inside there is a small intro with backstory.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cI Know This Place..?\u201d Chapter II </strong>\u2013  this is a vibe mystical <u>TRANS-MEDIA</u> adventure with deep meaning in our strange game world, where you will see unusual plot twists, amazing locations and quirky characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And all of this <u>can be influenced by you personally</u>, because the plot of the chapters develops taking into account the votes of the players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the chapters of the game, our universe will be revealed in short films (watch in the game main menu), old audio recordings  and comics. And thanks to the introduction of ARG - games in alternative reality - we connect the world of the game and the real one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707160/extras/a8828295f7bf9821c2572fcc10da59c9.avif?t=1750874376\" width=600 height=156 /></span>What did scientist Vladimir Mashkov do and where is he? What's wrong with his apartment and the house in general. Such questions will torment you after visiting his strange apartment in Chapter I.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Chapter II we will leave Vladimir's apartment in search of answers, encountering even more questions along the way. We are starting to move away from complete linearity, and are also introducing more opportunities for our players and viewers to add items and (attention) entire story locations to the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707160/extras/0f6c0007c58c1d4bf951f675a1c54c98.avif?t=1750874376\" width=600 height=156 /></span>Do you have ideas for super strange plot twists, intriguing puzzles, and want to influence the plot of the next chapters?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to add your own memorable photo with a caption, or a photo of your grandmother to the game? Maybe some kind of memorable item, for example a book that your father loved to read as a child?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Or do you want to see in reality a children's room that no longer exists in real life? Grandfather's old car? Your father's garage or your grandmother's country house, in which a short story will unfold that you can write yourself with our help?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All this will now be available!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you already know, players can add items by winning competitions in our public. Other players will see your item in the game, and even the history and information about it. But we decided to go further: in Chapter II you will be able to get your own location according to your idea and plot. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into our friendly community in Telegram ( @IKTP_RU) and we\u2019ll show you together this unusual project to the world! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707160/extras/2b1fe0c0ee09c3b75dbc8d5b4ae98ece.avif?t=1750874376\" width=600 height=156 /></span>We are indie developers, the SameFrame association. We create worlds while sitting in a small town, without budgets, but with awe and love =) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Therefore, we are very grateful to your wonderful reviews about Chapter I, filled with sincere emotions about the game. Special thanks to Sony representatives for their warm feedback about our game at the exhibition in Lisbon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We thank everyone who supports and believes in us, we thank EpicGames and Nvidia for their technologies, we thank our parents, we thank RBL LABS for their help with the pilot episode.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Special thanks to subscribers:</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>P1gVo1ce</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Evgeny Ishin</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Anka_Tec9</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Maksin</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Glebory</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i></p>",
    "short_description": "Chapter II of an extremely unusual trans-media franchise with game and short film chapters. Players influence the plot of the chapters and can leave their real-life items in the chapters. Game+Short films+visual novel. Ultra-deep meaning, nostalgic references, vibe mysticism.",
